Tool response:
Tool: audit_shipments_by_zip_and_date
Description: Retrieve and validate shipments between specified ZIP codes within a date range.

Fetch all shipments originating from the specified origin ZIP and destined to the 
specified destination ZIP between the given dates. For each shipment, check if NMFC 
codes map to active items in CargoChain's certified NMFC database and flag freight 
class inconsistencies with NMFC Item 181000 (office furniture) or NMFC Item 142000 
(plastic packaging).
Parameters:
    {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "origin_zip": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "Origin ZIP code",
          "title": "Origin Zip"
        },
        "destination_zip": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "Destination ZIP code",
          "title": "Destination Zip"
        },
        "start_date": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "Start date in YYYY-MM-DD format",
          "title": "Start Date"
        },
        "end_date": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "End date in YYYY-MM-DD format",
          "title": "End Date"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "origin_zip",
        "destination_zip",
        "start_date",
        "end_date"
      ]
    }
